{"id":"permanence","lemma":"permanence","pos":"noun","rank":4006,"glosses":["permanence (state of being permanent)","homeroom (classroom or classes)"],"ipa":"/pɛʁ.ma.nɑ̃s/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"permanences"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/8/8f/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Sartus85-permanence.wav","examples":[{"text":"J’y pense en permanence.","en":"I think about it all the time.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"there"},{"g":"to think","l":"penser"},{"g":"in / of it"},null]},{"text":"Il m'empruntait de l'argent en permanence.","en":"He was constantly borrowing money from me.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"me"},{"g":"to borrow )","l":"emprunter"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"money"},{"g":"in / of it"},null]},{"text":"Les ordinateurs sont améliorés en permanence.","en":"Computers are constantly being improved.","words":[{"g":"the / them","l":"le"},{"g":"a computer","l":"ordinateur"},{"g":"to be","l":"être"},null,{"g":"in / of it"},null]},{"text":"Nous sommes en permanence à la recherche de nouveaux bénévoles.","en":"We're always looking for new volunteers.","words":[{"g":"we / us"},{"g":"to be","l":"être"},{"g":"in / of it"},null,null,null,{"g":"research"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"new, novel","l":"nouveau"},{"g":"voluntary, unpaid","l":"bénévole"}],"phrases":[[4,6,"a la"]]},{"text":"Tom regarde la télévision en permanence.","en":"Tom is always watching TV.","words":[null,{"g":"to look at","l":"regarder"},{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"television"},{"g":"in / of it"},null]}]}